<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Japanese government bond.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Japanese government bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the 3.60 pct Japanese government bond due June 2005, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	 ISS PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	108.0 PCT	2.12 DEM    0.99 PCT     68.36 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	 105.0 PCT	2.53 DEM    4.98 PCT     57.28 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	108.0 PCT	1.75 SFR    0.97 PCT     69.47 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	 105.0 PCT	2.08 SFR    4.95 PCT     58.44 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL E	108.0 PCT    158.28 YEN    0.99 PCT     68.56 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	 105.0 PCT    189.00 YEN    4.98 PCT     57.41 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.NOV.96-15.OCT.97   PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   *			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> NOTES	     *DEM DENOMINATED LISTED FFT AND DDF</p>
<p>			SFR DENOMINATED LISTED ZURICH</p>
<p>			YEN DENOMINATED LISTED LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p>			PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  SFAA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
